### Post course
POST http://localhost:3000/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "instructor_id": 3,
  "category_id": 1,
  "title": "Course Mastery Something",
  "slug": "ielts-writing-task-2",
  "description": "Learn the fundamentals of IELTS Speaking.",
  "prerequisite_text": "Basic English knowledge",
  "thumbnail_url": "../frontend/frontendSE/public/course-assets/academic-mastery.png",
  "status": "published",
  "is_featured": true
}
### Get course with ID 6
GET http://localhost:3000/api/courses/6
### GET course
GET http://localhost:3000/courses
### Course search
GET http://localhost:3000/api/courses

### Course search base on word
GET http://localhost:3000/api/courses?search=ielts

### Course search - error
GET http://localhost:3000/api/courses?page=0

### Filter - skill only
GET http://localhost:3000/api/courses?skill=reading

### Filter - listening B2
GET http://localhost:3000/api/courses?skill=listening&level=b2

### Filter - listening C1
GET http://localhost:3000/api/courses?skill=listening&level=c1

### Filter - reading B2
GET http://localhost:3000/api/courses?skill=reading&level=b2

### Filter - listening A2 (no result)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/courses?skill=listening&level=a2

### Filter - error: level without skill
GET http://localhost:3000/api/courses?level=b2

### Filter - error: wrong skill
GET http://localhost:3000/api/courses?skill=cooking
